<div class="intro-text">

  <p>
    Hi! I'm Karthick, a student, artist, and developer interested in the pre-med track. Although at first glance, that may seem contradicting, I believe that art is a medium that can communicate between any two subjects; in my case, between medicine and technology.
  </p>

<p>
  As for my passion and interest in the human body, I have always been fascinated by the work of art the body is. The intertwining of muscle fibers, the intricate yet precise nature of nerves that form our very consciousness- there's a certain beauty to be found there. 
  Ever since I was a child, I understood the heavy burdens that doctors carried. My parents would continuously talk about the strain that we put our body through, and how we have a responsibility to take care of it. 
  However, it was one incident that led to my sudden interest in medicine. My grandma was diagnosed with a spine tumor
</p>

